@@s004 atlas of Advanced Programming
@@s005 Functional programming in <b>Scala 3</b>: no variables, no loops, no exceptions. Every topic here is taken apart one step at a time, from the smallest symbol up to the code of the exercises.
@@s006 The course at a glance
@@s007 Exam
@@s008 <b>Written, 4 hours</b><br>Mon 4 January 2027, 9:00–13:00, in person. No AI.
@@s009 To be admitted
@@s010 <b>5 homework passed</b> out of 10 assessed. It passes if it compiles and fails at most 5–6 tests.
